      "business_objective": "Consolidate brick-and-mortar retail and digital e-commerce transactions, real-time inventory snapshots across warehouses and stores, supplier purchase orders, carrier shipping logistics, and customer loyalty records into a unified Microsoft Fabric OneLake platform for real-time executive KPI reporting.",
