    "solution_summary": {
      "target_architecture": "Microsoft Fabric Medallion Architecture (PostgreSQL Source 'retail_ops' -> 01 Raw Bronze Lakehouse -> 02 Stage Curation & Quality PySpark Notebooks -> 03 Silver Harmonized Lakehouse -> 04 Gold Kimball Star Schema Warehouse -> Direct Lake Power BI Semantic Model -> Dedicated Master Orchestrator Pipeline in 'Pipeline Orchestration')",
      "target_folder_structure": {
        "root_folder": "Retail_Omnichannel_Platform",
        "subfolders": {
          "raw": "01 Raw",
          "stage": "02 Stage",
          "silver": "03 Silver",
          "gold": "04 Gold",
          "orchestration": "Pipeline Orchestration"
        }
      },
      "engineering_best_practices": [
        "Folder Containment Isolation: Notebooks are strictly placed in '02 Stage' (never in '01 Raw'). Master DAG Orchestrator is placed in dedicated 'Pipeline Orchestration' folder.",
        "Multi-Cell Interactive Synapse Compliance: Every PySpark notebook cell is bounded by # CELL and # METADATA blocks for interactive cell execution in Microsoft Fabric.",
        "Bronze Layer (01 Raw): Immutable landing in 'lh_retail_bronze' preserving full source fidelity, enriched with ingestion audit metadata (_ingested_at, _source_schema, _batch_run_id).",
        "Dual Ingestion Strategy: High-watermark CDC extraction on updated_at/ordered_at for transactional tables (orders, order_items, shipments, inventory_snapshots, returns); full snapshot refresh for dimensional master tables (customers, products, stores, suppliers, carriers).",
        "Salted SHA-256 PII Protection: Deterministic irreversible hashing applied to customer personal attributes (email, phone, street_address, first_name, last_name) before Silver promotion.",
        "Silver Layer (03 Silver): ACID Delta Lake tables in 'lh_retail_silver' with windowed ROW_NUMBER() deduplication, null-key quarantine, and PySpark MERGE INTO upserts on primary keys.",
        "Gold Layer (04 Gold): Kimball Star Schema warehouse 'wh_retail_gold' with 6 Conformed Dimensions and 4 Transactional/Snapshot Fact tables with conformed surrogate keys (_sk).",
        "Data Quality Gates: Great Expectations assertions suite verifying referential integrity, zero orphan line items, and non-negative financial values."
      ],
